{"id":292,"slug":"292-settimeout-fn-0-co-thuc-su-chay-ngay-khong","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Promise & Async","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"setTimeout(fn, 0) có thực sự chạy ngay không?","question_en":"Does setTimeout(fn, 0) actually run immediately?","answer_vi":"Không. `setTimeout(fn, 0)` **đưa callback vào macrotask queue**, nên nó chỉ chạy sau khi call stack rỗng **và toàn bộ microtask đã xử lý xong**.\n\n```javascript\nconsole.log('1')\nsetTimeout(() => console.log('4'), 0)\nPromise.resolve().then(() => console.log('3'))\nconsole.log('2')\n// 1 → 2 → 3 → 4   — callback setTimeout chạy sau mọi microtask đã xếp hàng (Promise.then), dù đăng ký trước\n```\n\nNgoài ra spec HTML quy định **độ trễ tối thiểu 4ms** khi timer lồng từ tầng thứ 5 trở đi:\n\n```javascript\nlet n = 0\nfunction tick() {\n  if (++n < 10) setTimeout(tick, 0)   // từ lần thứ 5 trở đi bị kẹp về ~4ms\n}\ntick()\n```\n\nTab chạy nền còn bị throttle mạnh hơn nữa (thường 1000ms) để tiết kiệm pin.\n\nMuốn chạy sớm nhất có thể **sau code đồng bộ** thì dùng microtask:\n\n```javascript\nqueueMicrotask(() => doSomething())   // trước mọi setTimeout\n```\n\nMuốn **nhường lượt cho browser vẽ** rồi mới chạy tiếp thì phải là macrotask:\n\n```javascript\nsetTimeout(next, 0)          // cách cũ\nawait scheduler.yield()      // Chrome/Edge 129+, Firefox 142+ (Safari chưa có), chuẩn hơn cho việc cắt long task\n```\n\n**Chốt:** `setTimeout(fn, 0)` không có nghĩa \"ngay lập tức\" mà là **\"sau khi lượt hiện tại và mọi microtask xong\"** — dùng nó khi cần cho browser cơ hội render, không dùng khi cần chạy sớm","answer_en":"No. `setTimeout(fn, 0)` **queues the callback as a macrotask**, so it runs only after the call stack empties **and every microtask has been processed**.\n\n```javascript\nconsole.log('1')\nsetTimeout(() => console.log('4'), 0)\nPromise.resolve().then(() => console.log('3'))\nconsole.log('2')\n// 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4   — the setTimeout callback runs after every already-queued microtask (Promise.then), even though it was registered first\n```\n\nThe HTML spec also mandates a **4ms minimum** once timers nest five levels deep:\n\n```javascript\nlet n = 0\nfunction tick() {\n  if (++n < 10) setTimeout(tick, 0)   // clamped to ~4ms from the fifth call on\n}\ntick()\n```\n\nBackground tabs are throttled far harder (often 1000ms) to save battery.\n\nTo run as early as possible **after synchronous code**, use a microtask:\n\n```javascript\nqueueMicrotask(() => doSomething())   // before any setTimeout\n```\n\nTo **let the browser paint** before continuing, you need a macrotask:\n\n```javascript\nsetTimeout(next, 0)          // the old way\nawait scheduler.yield()      // Chrome/Edge 129+, Firefox 142+ (not in Safari yet), the proper tool for splitting long tasks\n```\n\n**Takeaway:** `setTimeout(fn, 0)` does not mean \"immediately\" but **\"after this turn and all microtasks\"** — reach for it to give the browser a chance to render, not to run something sooner","answer_html_vi":"<p>Không. <code>setTimeout(fn, 0)</code> <strong>đưa callback vào macrotask queue</strong>, nên nó chỉ chạy sau khi call stack rỗng <strong>và toàn bộ microtask đã xử lý xong</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"console.log('1')\nsetTimeout(() =&gt; console.log('4'), 0)\nPromise.resolve().then(() =&gt; console.log('3'))\nconsole.log('2')\n// 1 → 2 → 3 → 4   — callback setTimeout chạy sau mọi microtask đã xếp hàng (Promise.then), dù đăng ký trước\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;1&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">setTimeout</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;4&#x27;</span>), <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">resolve</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">then</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;3&#x27;</span>))\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;2&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 1 → 2 → 3 → 4   — callback setTimeout chạy sau mọi microtask đã xếp hàng (Promise.then), dù đăng ký trước</span></code></pre></div><p>Ngoài ra spec HTML quy định <strong>độ trễ tối thiểu 4ms</strong> khi timer lồng từ tầng thứ 5 trở đi:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"let n = 0\nfunction tick() {\n  if (++n &lt; 10) setTimeout(tick, 0)   // từ lần thứ 5 trở đi bị kẹp về ~4ms\n}\ntick()\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> n = <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">tick</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (++n &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>) <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">setTimeout</span>(tick, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// từ lần thứ 5 trở đi bị kẹp về ~4ms</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">tick</span>()</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Tab chạy nền còn bị throttle mạnh hơn nữa (thường 1000ms) để tiết kiệm pin.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Muốn chạy sớm nhất có thể <strong>sau code đồng bộ</strong> thì dùng microtask:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"queueMicrotask(() =&gt; doSomething())   // trước mọi setTimeout\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">queueMicrotask</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">doSomething</span>())   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// trước mọi setTimeout</span></code></pre></div><p>Muốn <strong>nhường lượt cho browser vẽ</strong> rồi mới chạy tiếp thì phải là macrotask:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"setTimeout(next, 0)          // cách cũ\nawait scheduler.yield()      // Chrome/Edge 129+, Firefox 142+ (Safari chưa có), chuẩn hơn cho việc cắt long task\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">setTimeout</span>(next, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// cách cũ</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> scheduler.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">yield</span>()      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Chrome/Edge 129+, Firefox 142+ (Safari chưa có), chuẩn hơn cho việc cắt long task</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Chốt:</strong> <code>setTimeout(fn, 0)</code> không có nghĩa \"ngay lập tức\" mà là <strong>\"sau khi lượt hiện tại và mọi microtask xong\"</strong> — dùng nó khi cần cho browser cơ hội render, không dùng khi cần chạy sớm.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>No. <code>setTimeout(fn, 0)</code> <strong>queues the callback as a macrotask</strong>, so it runs only after the call stack empties <strong>and every microtask has been processed</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"console.log('1')\nsetTimeout(() =&gt; console.log('4'), 0)\nPromise.resolve().then(() =&gt; console.log('3'))\nconsole.log('2')\n// 1 -&gt; 2 -&gt; 3 -&gt; 4   — the setTimeout callback runs after every already-queued microtask (Promise.then), even though it was registered first\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;1&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">setTimeout</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;4&#x27;</span>), <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">resolve</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">then</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;3&#x27;</span>))\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;2&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 1 -&gt; 2 -&gt; 3 -&gt; 4   — the setTimeout callback runs after every already-queued microtask (Promise.then), even though it was registered first</span></code></pre></div><p>The HTML spec also mandates a <strong>4ms minimum</strong> once timers nest five levels deep:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"let n = 0\nfunction tick() {\n  if (++n &lt; 10) setTimeout(tick, 0)   // clamped to ~4ms from the fifth call on\n}\ntick()\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> n = <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">tick</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (++n &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>) <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">setTimeout</span>(tick, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// clamped to ~4ms from the fifth call on</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">tick</span>()</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Background tabs are throttled far harder (often 1000ms) to save battery.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">To run as early as possible <strong>after synchronous code</strong>, use a microtask:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"queueMicrotask(() =&gt; doSomething())   // before any setTimeout\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">queueMicrotask</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">doSomething</span>())   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// before any setTimeout</span></code></pre></div><p>To <strong>let the browser paint</strong> before continuing, you need a macrotask:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"setTimeout(next, 0)          // the old way\nawait scheduler.yield()      // Chrome/Edge 129+, Firefox 142+ (not in Safari yet), the proper tool for splitting long tasks\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">setTimeout</span>(next, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// the old way</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> scheduler.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">yield</span>()      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Chrome/Edge 129+, Firefox 142+ (not in Safari yet), the proper tool for splitting long tasks</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> <code>setTimeout(fn, 0)</code> does not mean \"immediately\" but <strong>\"after this turn and all microtasks\"</strong> — reach for it to give the browser a chance to render, not to run something sooner.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — setTimeout: reasons for delays","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/setTimeout#reasons_for_delays_longer_than_specified"},{"label":"MDN — queueMicrotask()","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/queueMicrotask"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"}]}